OL,3,GNEWSAFire service called twice for
OL,4,Apeople stuck in loos
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has apologised after two
OL,7,Fpeople became trapped in a seaside
OL,8,Ftoilet block within 30 minutes of each
OL,9,Fother.
OL,11,FTeignmouth Town Council said the fire
OL,12,Fservice was called after a member of
OL,13,Fthe public became stuck in a cubicle at
OL,14,FThe Den public toilets on Saturday due
OL,15,Fto a "faulty door lock".
OL,17,FDevon and Somerset Fire and Rescue
OL,18,FService said after freeing the man, it
OL,19,Fwas called again less than 30 minutes
OL,20,Flater to reports of a second trapped
OL,21,Fperson.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
