OL,3,GNEWSAFire service called twice for
OL,4,Apeople stuck in loos
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeignmouth Town Council apologised for
OL,7,Fthe "distress and inconvenience" caused
OL,8,Fand said: "We would like to reassure
OL,9,Fresidents that the council has taken
OL,10,Fthe matter seriously."
